      "code": "IPIP-AB5C",
      "name": "IPIP AB5C",
      "abbreviation": "IPIP-AB5C",
      "description": "Meta-scale aggregating all 44 IPIP-AB5C subscales. Each subscale is a separate section controlled by a boolean parameter. Intended primarily for translation and bulk administration.",
